        <briefdescription>
<para>Run the wrapper pass to rebuild an aggregation over known <ref refid="namespacellvm_1_1_a_a" kindref="compound">AA</ref> passes. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>This is the legacy pass manager&apos;s interface to the new-style <ref refid="namespacellvm_1_1_a_a" kindref="compound">AA</ref> results aggregation object. Because this is somewhat shoe-horned into the legacy pass manager, we hard code all the specific alias analyses available into it. While the particular set enabled is configured via commandline flags, adding a new alias analysis to LLVM will require adding support for it to this list. </para>
        </detaileddescription>
